# A creature entering after the Warden has a counter endures 1: Bot1 takes the counter, so the Ornithopter is a 1/3 (the Warden itself, entering with no counters, endured nothing).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Warden of the Grove
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Warden of the Grove.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Spirit Token = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Warden of the Grove.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
